,null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-300 mt-1\",\"children\":\"Honeypot fleet behavioral data\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"href\":\"/indices/sophistication\",\"className\":\"border border-white/10 rounded p-3 hover:border-teal-500/60 transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-400\",\"children\":\"Sophistication Index\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-bold text-white\",\"children\":\"Distribution-only\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-300 mt-1\",\"children\":\"Mean withheld pending classifier validation\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"27:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"border-t border-gray-800 pt-6 text-xs text-gray-400 space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"Authorship.\"}],\" \",\"ARIA is OpenA2A's autonomous research system. Editorial review by Abdel Fane. Disclosure of authorship is a credibility move, not a limitation. We document how our content is made.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"Data integrity.\"}],\" No numbers in this report are estimated, modeled, or projected. Every value traces to a query against live instrumentation. Pre-publication audit per Black Hat reproducibility standards.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"License.\"}],\" Apache 2.0. Cite using the BibTeX or APA blocks in Section 9.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"Coordinated disclosure.\"}],\" Any finding in this report that maps to a previously undisclosed vulnerability is held under the 90-day ARIAdesk disclosure protocol. None of the surface-level findings in this report require disclosure coordination.\"]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"28:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"changes\",\"aria-labelledby\":\"changes-heading\",\"data-changes\":\"\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-20 mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"changes-heading\",\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-white\",\"children\":\"Changes to this report\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"role\":\"list\",\"className\":\"list-none p-0 m-0 space-y-4 *:scroll-mt-20 *:border-l-2 *:border-white/15 *:pl-4 *:text-sm *:leading-relaxed *:text-gray-300\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"id\":\"erratum-behaviour-breakdowns-withheld\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-20\",\"children\":[\"Erratum (\",\"2026-10-25\",\"): \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#breakdowns-withheld\",\"className\":\"text-teal-300 hover:underline\",\"children\":\"the classifier verdicts, the protocol split and the user-agent categories\"}],\" are withdrawn, with every sentence and recommendation clause resting on them and the shares the protocol-shares entry below quoted. Each row needs ten or more distinct client addresses, and no count of them was on record when the next edition was published, so that could not be confirmed.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"id\":\"erratum-distinct-fingerprints\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-20\",\"children\":[\"Erratum (\",\"2026-10-10\",\"): the TrapMyAgent card in the row of figures under the summary was published as \\\"Unique fingerprints\\\". The count is distinct fingerprints, the term the rest of this report uses for it. The value is unchanged.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"id\":\"erratum-protocol-shares\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-20\",\"children\":[\"Erratum (\",\"2026-10-05\",\"): each protocol share, and the MCP share the lede and a recommendation gave in words, divided a count from the 30-day window by an approximate count of every event the fleet had recorded since launch, which is not the population the counts describe. The shares were restated over the events in the three published event types; whether the window held events of other types is not verified. The counts were unchanged. The figures this entry quoted are removed; see the entry above.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"id\":\"erratum-breakdowns-withheld\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-20\",\"children\":[\"Erratum (\",\"2026-09-25\",\"): \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#breakdowns-withheld\",\"className\":\"text-teal-300 hover:underline\",\"children\":\"the AgentPwn category, ATT\u0026CK, country and cloud-provider breakdowns\"}],\" are withdrawn, with the count of countries, one recommendation and every other sentence resting on them. Section 4 was headed \\\"The adversary picture\\\"; almost all its traffic is automated scanning.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Erratum (2026-09-24): the persistence finding was published as \\\"45% of unique attackers return\\\". The lede, the recommendation and the report summary described the same count in the same terms. The count is distinct fingerprints that appeared in more than one session. A fingerprint is a value the sensors record, not a person, an organization or an attacker. The value is unchanged. A figure for a single fingerprint was removed from the same finding and its recommendation, because a figure about one source can single that source out.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Erratum (2026-08-26): a callback is a fetch of the canary URL, not proof that an agent followed the payload. The recorded fetch population is browsers, crawlers, and untyped clients, and the rate named above has since been withdrawn as not measurable. See the methodology page.\"}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"29:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$2d\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@66\"}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2f:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full h-2 bg-white/[0.06] rounded-[2px] overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"h-full rounded-[2px] bg-teal-400/70\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"0.12%\"}}]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300 text-sm mt-5 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"Month-over-month exposure delta.\"}],\" The May 12 sweep counted\",\" \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"297,723\"}],\" exposed AI services, down from \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"321,929\"}],\" \",\"on April 10, a drop of\",\" \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"24,206\"}],\" \",\"services (-\",8,\"%). The decrease is concentrated in OpenClaw gateway exposure, which fell from 263,853 to\",\" \",\"228,652\",\" (\",13,\"% reduction). MCP servers rose from 1,134 to \",\"1,322\",\", the first month a dedicated A2A endpoint count was broken out separately (\",22,\" services).\"]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300 text-sm\",\"children\":\"Cross-stream comparison is the first signal a reader should take. AgentPwn and TrapMyAgent observe attacker behavior in interactive environments. HoneyMap samples bait planted by others on the open web. ARIAscout measures exposed surface that has not yet been touched. Together the four streams cover the arc from latent exposure to active attack to wild-seeded bait, all measured within a two-day window for this edition.\"}]\n32:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"60\",{\"x\":147.33333333333331,\"y\":147.33333333333331,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n33:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"61\",{\"x\":171.55555555555554,\"y\":147.33333333333331,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n34:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"62\",{\"x\":195.77777777777777,\"y\":147.33333333333331,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n35:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"63\",{\"x\":2,\"y\":171.55555555555554,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n36:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"64\",{\"x\":26.22222222222222,\"y\":171.55555555555554,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n37:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"65\",{\"x\":50.44444444444444,\"y\":171.55555555555554,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n38:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"66\",{\"x\":74.66666666666666,\"y\":171.55555555555554,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n39:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"67\",{\"x\":98.88888888888889,\"y\":171.55555555555554,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"68\",{\"x\":123.11111111111111,\"y\":171.55555555555554,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"69\",{\"x\":147.33333333333331,\"y\":171.55555555555554,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"70\",{\"x\":171.55555555555554,\"y\":171.55555555555554,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"71\",{\"x\":195.77777777777777,\"y\":171.55555555555554,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"72\",{\"x\":2,\"y\":195.77777777777777,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"73\",{\"x\":26.22222222222222,\"y\":195.77777777777777,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n40:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"74\",{\"x\":50.44444444444444,\"y\":195.77777777777777,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n41:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"75\",{\"x\":74.66666666666666,\"y\":195.77777777777777,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n42:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"76\",{\"x\":98.88888888888889,\"y\":195.77777777777777,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n43:[\"$\",\"rect\",\"7"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"7\",{\"x\":123.11111111111111,\"y\":195.77777777777777,\"width\":22.22222222222222,\"height\":22.22222222222222,\"rx\":2,\"className\":\"fill-gray-800\"}]\n44:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2 max-w-[14rem] font-mono\",\"children\":\"One of every 78 agents that encountered a payload followed it to a measurable endpoint. The other 77 did not.\"}]\n45:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3\",\"children\":[\"On the baseline AgentPwn fleet, \",\"1,763\",\" of\",\" \",\"136,954\",\" interactions resolved to a payload callback, an aggregate rate of \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"1.29%\"}],\". That rate is the share of agents that followed an injection to a measurable endpoint. It does not measure downstream impact. Small enough that defenders can hope to catch the followers. Large enough that the injection class is not theoretical.\"]}]}]\n46:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3\",\"children\":[\"Sector breakdown surfaces a sharper signal. On the AgentPwn security-vertical honeypot population (806 agent fingerprints, 1,419 attempts), \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"1,350 attempts (95.1%)\"}],\" \",\"resulted in a payload callback. This is a real finding, not a sampling artifact. Security-tooling agents that ingest external content trust security-flavored content more than general content, and that trust is exploitable. Any defender shipping an agent that reads security-research or vulnerability-database text into an LLM context window should assume an attacker has already considered the attack surface that 95.1% measures.\"]}]\n47:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"The delta cohort (authenticated-surface archetypes, currently 1 of 5 planned live as\",\" \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-gray-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-xs\",\"children\":\"cloudops-agent-io\"}],\") drew zero organic traffic in the window after operator-self-test rows are excluded by query-layer filter. This is itself a finding. Authenticated and dynamic surfaces are systematically invisible to the crawler-class agents that dominated the baseline cohort. The deliberate emptiness of the delta cohort is the most direct measurement of the Common Crawl gap thesis discussed in Section 8.\"]}]\n48:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex justify-between mb-1 text-[12px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-gray-300\",\"children\":[\"Script literal (embedded in JS)\",null]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-white\",\"children\":[\"133\",null]}]]}]\n49:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full h-2 bg-white/[0.06] rounded-[2px] overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"h-full rounded-[2px] bg-teal-400/70\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"100.00%\"}}]}]\n4a:[\"$\",\"div\",\"HTML comment-1\",{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-3 items-center\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex justify-between mb-1 text-[12px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-gray-300\",\"children\":[\"HTML comment\",null]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-white\",\"children\":[\"81\",null]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full h-2 bg-white/[0.06] rounded-[2px] overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"h-full rounded-[2px] bg-teal-400/70\"